&lt;strong&gt;Tools&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p style="color:#555; margin-top: 8px;"&gt;Excel, Google Sheets, PostgreSQL&lt;/p&gt;





Where I’m Headed



I’m interested in decision science — the intersection of data, behaviour, and how people and organisations actually make choices. The kind of work where the output isn’t just a chart but something that changes what someone decides to do next.



Still figuring out the exact shape of it, but the direction is clear enough.

Hi, I’m Alnura



3rd year Data Science student at CEU. I wrangle data, cook questionable meals, and spiritually identify as a horse. Welcome to my corner of the internet.










